Package: rusckersso
Title: Sign People in Through a 'Ruscker' Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("André", "Leite", email = "leite@castlab.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4718-9766"))
Description: Helpers for R web applications that need to know who is
    using them, when the people are managed by a 'Ruscker' portal
    <https://ruscker.com/>. Applications hosted inside the portal read the
    identity that the portal's proxy adds to every request. 'shiny' and
    'plumber2' applications running elsewhere sign people in through the
    portal's 'OpenID Connect' provider (authorization code flow with
    'PKCE', 'ES256'-signed ID tokens), using 'httr2' for HTTP and 'jose'
    for signature verification. The provider and its claims are described
    at <https://ruscker.com/authentication.html>.
